Wyvern Fang\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wyvern_Fang_5eae53.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Fur Boots\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fur_Boots_c74b7a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Brutetamer's Staff\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Brutetamer_s_Staff_64ae74.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Formorgar Glacier Mammoths 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"106\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Formorgar_Glacier_Mammoths_1_bdaff2.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Formorgar Glacier Mammoths 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"155\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Formorgar_Glacier_Mammoths_2_66c32b.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.00<br/>June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThere are two places on/near the <a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Glacier\">Formorgar Glacier</a> where you can hunt <a href=\"#/wiki/Mammoth\">Mammoths</a>. One is west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>, near <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Bloodtusk\">The Bloodtusks</a> lair. The other one is south-west of the city and has more <a href=\"#/wiki/Mammoth\">Mammoths</a>.\n</p><p>To reach the <b>smaller</b> Mammoth hunting area you can take two routes.\n</p>\n<ol><li>Walk west from <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>, cross a small bridge and levitate up 5 times <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32172,31161,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32172, 31161, 7)</a></li>\n<li>Walk north from <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a> by going up two ramps <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32245,31112,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32245, 31112, 7)</a> and walk west to a frozen waterfall <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32148,31080,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32148, 31080, 5)</a>. Levitate up 3 times.</li></ol>\n<p>To reach the <b>bigger</b> Mammoth area you can also take two routes.\n</p>\n<ol><li>Walk west from <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>, cross a small bridge and go up a ramp <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32180,31230,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32180, 31230, 7)</a>. This is the fastest route.</li>\n<li>Find <a href=\"#/wiki/Buddel\">Buddel</a> in the south of <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32255,31197,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32255, 31197, 7)</a> and ask him for a passage to the <b>raider camp</b>. He will take you <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32153,31375,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32153, 31375, 7)</a> for 50 gp. From there walk north and go up a ramp <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32158,31355,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32158, 31355, 7)</a>.</li></ol>\n<p>It is a good idea to find <a href=\"#/wiki/Grizzly%20Adams\">Grizzly Adams</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a> and ask him for a task to hunt mammoths, before hunting <a href=\"#/wiki/Mammoth\">Mammoths</a>. Optionally you could combine the mammoth task with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Badger\">Badger</a> task, since they can be found in the <b>bigger</b> Mammoth area.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Badger\"><img alt=\"Badger\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Badger_32b7fb.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Badger\">Badger</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">5</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">23</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">12 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Beetroot\">Beetroot</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Badger Fur (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Acorn\">Acorn</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Rabbit\"><img alt=\"Silver Rabbit\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Silver_Rabbit_d85c65.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Rabbit\">Silver Rabbit</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">15</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">0 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Silky Fur (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrot\">Carrot</a> (uncommon)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Troll\"><img alt=\"Frost Troll\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Frost_Troll_fbd717.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Troll\">Frost Troll</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">23</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">55</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">20 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-12× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rapier\">Rapier</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Spear\">Spear</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Twigs (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Wooden Shield (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Frosty Ear of a Troll (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Coat (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Penguin\"><img alt=\"Penguin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Penguin_ce9a0c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Penguin\">Penguin</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">33</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">3 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\">Green Perch</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\">Rainbow Trout</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Winter%20Wolf\"><img alt=\"Winter Wolf\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" l